# Generated LVGL fonts are tracked on purpose: main/CMakeLists.txt auto-detects
# them and silently falls back to the built-in LVGL faces when they are missing,
# so a clone without them would render with different typography.
# Regeneration is described in main/ui/fonts/README.md.

# Panel variant manifest is generated from main/idf_component.panel{4,10}.yml
# by the top-level CMakeLists.txt on every configure. Do not edit or commit.
main/idf_component.yml

